title: Saarland Landtag Election
subtitle:
view-if: year = 1970 and month == 6
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
on-arrival:
set-jump: post_election_1970_sa
tags: event

= Saarland Landtag Election

The Landtag of Saarland is getting elected.

- @election_algorithm: May we do our best...

@post_election_1970_sa
on-arrival: {!
var sa_adjustment_factors = {
    spd: 0.85,
    cdu: 1.2,
    fdp: 0.8,
    npd: 0.8,
    other: 1.0,
};

var new_party_sum = 0;
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    Q.spd_sa = Q.spd_votes*sa_adjustment_factors.spd;
    Q.cdu_sa = Q.cdu_votes*sa_adjustment_factors.cdu;
    Q.fdp_sa = Q.fdp_votes*sa_adjustment_factors.fdp;
    Q.npd_sa = Q.npd_votes*sa_adjustment_factors.npd;
    Q.other_sa = Q.other_votes*sa_adjustment_factors.other;

    if (Q[party + '_sa'] < 5 || party == 'other' || Q[party + '_banned']) {
        Q[party + '_sa'] = 0;
    }

    new_party_sum += Q[party + '_sa'];
}
// calculate new party sum if electoral reform
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    if (Q[party + '_sa'] > 0) {
        Q[party + '_sa'] = Math.round(Q[party + '_sa']*1000/new_party_sum)/10;
    }
}

// get change arrows and signs


// The largest party can only be the CDU or the SPD.
Q.largest_party = 'SPD';
if (Q.cdu_sa >= Q.spd_sa) {
    Q.largest_party_sa = 'CDU';
}

// coalitions
Q.social_liberal_coalition_sa = Q.spd_sa + Q.fdp_sa;
Q.grand_coalition_sa = Q.spd_sa + Q.cdu_sa;
Q.bourgeois_coalition_sa = Q.fdp_sa + Q.cdu_sa;

var election_result = {'date': new Date(Q.year, Q.month - 1)};
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    election_result[party] = Q[party + '_sa'];
}
Q.election_records.push(election_result);
!}
on-departure:
on-display: {!
data = []
data.push({
      "id": "spd",
      "legend": "SPD",
      "name": "SPD",
      "seats": Math.round(Q.spd_sa*2),
});
data.push({
      "id": "fdp",
      "legend": "FDP",
      "name": "FDP",
      "seats": Math.round(Q.fdp_sa*2),
});
data.push({
      "id": "cdu",
      "legend": "CDU",
      "name": "CDU",
      "seats": Math.round(Q.cdu_sa*2),
});
data.push({
      "id": "npd",
      "legend": "NPD",
      "name": "NPD",
      "seats": Math.round(Q.npd_sa*2),
});
data.push({
      "id": "other",
      "legend": "Other",
      "name": "Other",
      "seats": Math.round(Q.other_sa*2),
});

if (window && d3) {
    var width = 500; 
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50; 
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("reichstag").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    } 

    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#reichstag").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}
go-to: coalition_menu

= Election results

{!<svg id="reichstag" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote share</td>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#C00000; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} **SPD:** {!</td><td>!} **[+ spd_sa +]%**

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#000000'> </div> !} CDU: {!</td><td>!} [+ cdu_sa +]% {!</td><td>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#FFCC00'> </div> !} FDP: {!</td><td>!} [+ fdp_sa +]% {!</td><td>!}
 
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#a0a0a0'> </div> !} Others: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_sa +] % {!</td><td>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#c26f2b'> </div> !} NPD: {!</td><td>!} [+ npd_sa +]% {!</td><td>!}
{!</table>!}

**Potential coalitions:**

<span style="color: #C00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberal</span> Coalition (<span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span>): [+ social_liberal_coalition_sa +]%

<span style="color: #C00000;">Grand</span> <span style="color: #000000;">Coalition</span> (<span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span>: [+ grand_coalition_sa +]%

<span style="color: #FFCC00;">Bour</span><span style="color: #000000;">geois</span> Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> + <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span>): [+ bourgeois_coalition_sa +]%

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

@coalition_menu

- @spd_majority
- @cdu_majority
- @social_liberal_coalition
- @grand_coalition
- @bourgeois_coalition

@cdu_majority
title: A <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> majority alone
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span>: [+ cdu_sa +]%
view-if: cdu_sa >= 50
on-arrival: sa_leader = "Röder"; sa_leader_party = "CDU"; sa_coalition = "CDU majority"; sa_next_election = "May 1975"

The <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> has formed a majority government...

@bourgeois_coalition
title: A <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Bour</span><span style="color: #000000;">geois</span> Coalition is formed.
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> + <span style="color: #286fe0;">**CSU**</span> + <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span> ([+ bourgeois_coalition_sa +]%)
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_sa >= 50
on-arrival: sa_leader = "Röder"; sa_leader_party = "CDU"; sa_coalition = "Bourgeois Coalition"; sa_next_election = "May 1975"

For some reason, we cannot or do not want to form a government. This has led to the <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> forming a coalition with the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span>.

@spd_majority
title: A <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> majority alone
subtitle: <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span>: [+ spd_sa +]%
view-if: spd_sa >= 50
on-arrival: sa_leader = "Conrad"; sa_leader_party = "SPD"; sa_coalition = "SPD majority"; sa_next_election = "May 1975"
achievement: majority_party

We can form a majority government!

@social_liberal_coalition
title: We can form a <span style="color: #C00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberal</span> Coalition.
subtitle: <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span> ([+ social_liberal_coalition_sa +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if fdp_relation < 60: The <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span> does not want to form a coalition with us. ?]
view-if: social_liberal_coalition_sa >= 50
choose-if: fdp_relation >= 60
on-arrival: sa_leader = "Conrad"; sa_leader_party = "SPD"; sa_coalition = "Social-liberal Coalition"; sa_next_election = "May 1975"; fdp_relation += 5 if spd_sa >= 50

[? if spd_sa < 50 : We have formed a coalition with the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span> ?][? if spd_sa >= 50 : Despite our majority, we have formed a coalition with the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**FDP**</span>. This has increased their opinion of us. ?]

@grand_coalition
title: We can form a <span style="color: #C00000;">Grand</span> <span style="color: #000000;">Coalition</span>.
view-if: grand_coalition_sa >= 50
choose-if: cdu_relation >= 60
subtitle: <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> ([+ grand_coalition_sa +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cdu_relation < 60: The <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> does not want to form a coalition with us. ?]
on-arrival: sa_leader = "Conrad" if largest_party_sa == "SPD"; sa_leader = "Röder" if largest_party_sa == "CDU"; sa_leader_party = "SPD" if largest_party_sa == "SPD"; sa_leader_party = "CDU" if largest_party_sa == "CDU"; sa_coalition = "Grand Coalition"; sa_next_election = "May 1975"; cdu_relation += 5 if spd_sa >= 50

[? if spd_sa < 50 : We have formed a coalition with the <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> ?][? if spd_sa >= 50 : Despite our majority, we have formed a coalition with the <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span>. This has increased their opinion of us. ?]
